	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["50CD3585A0E31EAD"]
			description: [
				"After the battle with the Hydra proved you could stand the heat you went off to investigate the Nether Realm, but your Magical Map still has some pictures on it that bear investigation."
				""
				"Your first stop is that incredibly dense forest surrounding an impossibly tall tower.  Near the edge fo the wood, you find yourself looking at some brick stabilized trenches with some sort of barrier preventing further exploration or entry, and a pedestal with odd markings on it.  After placing one of the trophies you took from one of the other greater beings on the pedestal, the subterranean domain of the goblins opens up and you can proceed inside."
				""
				"If it is anything like the rest of the places you've seen marked on the Magical Map, there's another guardian of some kind here for you to challenge."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:knight_phantom_trophy"
			id: "4E61F5225879DB6B"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "02996AB4335858D4"
