		{
			dependencies: ["4E61F5225879DB6B"]
			description: [
				"Those grave guardians were sustaining a barrier around the innermost part of this darkened wood.  Now that you can get close enough, you can see Ghasts floating around the tower like huge, annoying, fireball-spiiting, whiny balloons.  These are new though, they have red markings on them and seem to be more constrained in their movements."
				""
				"The top of the tower is covered in netherrack and flames, and there are strange machines powered by redstone.  Tiny versions of the red-accented ghasts float around these machines, and seem to get pulled into it...maybe you can find a way to make the machine pull that giant Ghast with the extra squiggly tentacles into it..."
			]
			icon: "twilightforest:ur_ghast_trophy"
			id: "50EEFEE9BAD96BF7"
