		{
			dependencies: ["50EEFEE9BAD96BF7"]
			description: [
				"There are only a couple more points of interest marked on the map with faces to explore.  They appear to be in cold places, and the next one looks like a big angry mouth full of teeth with either horns or hair surrounding it, it's hard to tell."
				""
				"Even once you enter the beast's cave you can't really tell if those blue things on its face are horns or not.  Looks like you aren't going to get a chance to ask, it's a savage creature and once it smells you in its home, the fight is on!"
