		{
			dependencies: ["38427A4B44D5A437"]
			description: [
				"One of the pillagers on the ship was carrying a Conch horn, standing around near a log book in the Captain's quarters."
				""
				"Seems like the Captain has been diving and searching the nearby seabed for something, latest entry in the log says she's been gone for more than a day on the last trip.  That doesn't bode well, no sir.  Diving suits generally only have enough air for an hour or two.  Unfortunately that log entry isn't dated, so there's no way to tell how long their Captain has been gone.  "
				""
				"I wonder if this is the same Cornelia that John mentioned..."
